Subject: Native cancellation control, typed syscall gates and cleanup frame identities
Origin: Filnix
Upstream-Status: Experimental, not submitted

Based on Fil-C b6dd63481f796f8bff8502165c7dfc61091dbbd6.
See docs/pthread-cancellation-implementation.md for the supported entry points,
validation and remaining limitations. This does not implement arbitrary async
cancellation or cancellation that unwinds out of an application signal handler.

